openmediavault-qnap (8.0.4) stable; urgency=low

  * Buttons page (System > QNAP > Buttons): the USB Copy button runs a
    chosen OMV Scheduled Task, blinking the USB LED while it runs; Reset
    held 3 seconds runs another (longer holds do nothing). Chassis open is
    logged and mailed.
  * Beeps (off by default): QTS patterns through the PC speaker when
    qnapd starts at boot (OMV beeps on shutdown itself), every 5 minutes
    while a fan has stopped, when a pool becomes degraded, failed or full
    or starts rebuilding, and when USB Copy fails.
  * confdb migration for beep, usbcopytask and resettask.

 -- Nader Eloshaiker <1904325+nader-eloshaiker@users.noreply.github.com>  Sun, 18 Oct 2026 12:58:59 +1100

openmediavault-qnap (8.0.3) stable; urgency=low

  * Night brightness: a lower front panel LED brightness between two
    times of day (Front panel page; off by default), with a confdb
    migration.
  * Fault notifications: a "QNAP hardware" event under System >
    Notification. When enabled, qnapd mails when a fan, temperature, disk
    or pool problem lasts a minute, when it clears, and if the daemon
    stops unexpectedly.
  * Dashboard gauges: round widgets for fan duty, QM2 fan duty and the
    hottest CPU, system, disk and NVMe temperature (new RPC getGauges).

